{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-03-02 10:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E SAYS ON MARCH 1, CO, DEBTORS ENTERED INTO AMENDED AND RESTATED BACKSTOP COMMITMENT LETTERS WITH SHAREHOLDER PROPONENTS', 'text': 'PG&E CORP -  ON MARCH 1, CO, DEBTORS ENTERED INTO AMENDED AND RESTATED BACKSTOP COMMITMENT LETTERS WITH SHAREHOLDER PROPONENTS.PG&E - MODIFICATIONS INCLUDE EXTENDING DEADLINE FOR BANKRUPTCY COURT APPROVAL OF AMENDED, RESTATED BACKSTOP COMMITMENT LETTERS TO MARCH 15, 2020.PG&E CORP - MODIFICATIONS INCLUDE PERMITTING DEBTORS TO IMPLEMENT CAPITAL STRUCTURE OUTLINED IN DEBTORS’ PLAN OF REORGANIZATION OII PREPARED TESTIMONY.PG&E - UNDER DEBTORS’ PLAN OF REORGANIZATION OII PREPARED TESTIMONY, NEW EQUITY FINANCING COMPONENT OF DEBTORS’ CAPITAL STRUCTURE WOULD BE $9.0 BILLION.PG&E - UNDER DEBTORS’ PLAN OF REORGANIZATION OII PREPARED TESTIMONY,CAPITAL STRUCTURE TO INCLUDE $6.0 BILLION “TAX BENEFITS MONETIZATION TRANSACTION”.PG&E - ON FEB. 28 DEBT COMMITMENT LETTERS WERE AMENDED TO EXTEND DEADLINE FOR GETTING BANKRUPTCY COURT APPROVAL OF DEBT COMMITMENT LETTERS TO MARCH 31.PG&E - INTENDS TO SEEK AMENDMENTS TO OTHER BACKSTOP COMMITMENT LETTERS, OR OBTAIN REPLACEMENTS, SUCH THAT BACKSTOP COMMITMENTS REMAIN AT $12.0 BILLION.PG&E CORP - AMENDED & RESTATED BACKSTOP COMMITMENT LETTERS ADJUST CIRCUMSTANCES UNDER WHICH BACKSTOP COMMITMENT PREMIUM IS SUBJECT TO CLAWBACK.PG&E - MODIFICATIONS INCLUDE CHANGING BACKSTOP COMMITMENT PREMIUM TO A FIXED NUMBER OF SHARES IN CASE BACKSTOP COMMITMENT PREMIUM IS PAID IN SHARES.'}